### {{ sec_num }}.1 Electrical Properties, Formation Water Resistivity & Saturation Equation

* **Saturation Model:** `{{ sw_params.model_name }}`
* **Free Water Level ($FWL$):** ${{ "%.1f"|format(sw_params.fwl) }}\text{ m TVDss}$ (Basis: `{{ sw_params.fwl_basis }}`)
* **Formation Water Salinity & Resistivity:** ${{ sw_params.salinity|int }}\text{ ppm NaCl equivalent}$, $R_w = {{ "%.3f"|format(sw_params.rw) }}\text{ }\Omega\cdot\text{m} \text{ @ } {{ "%.1f"|format(sw_params.temp) }}^\circ\text{C}$ ({{ sw_params.temp_basis }}).
* **Electrical Tortuosity, Cementation & Saturation Exponents:** $a = {{ sw_params.a }}$, $m = {{ sw_params.m }}$, $n = {{ sw_params.n }}$

{% if sw_params.model_key == 'waxman_smits' %}
$$S_w^n + B \cdot Q_v \cdot R_w \cdot S_w^{n-1} = \frac{a \cdot R_w}{\phi_t^m \cdot R_t} \quad \text{(Active Waxman-Smits Shaly-Sand)}$$
$$\text{Clean-Sand Baseline (Archie Reference): } S_w = \left(\frac{a \cdot R_w}{\phi_t^m \cdot R_t}\right)^{1/n}$$
{% elif sw_params.model_key == 'dual_water' %}
$$\frac{1}{R_t} = \frac{\phi_t^m}{a} \left( S_{wt}^n \frac{1}{R_{wf}} + S_{wb} \left( \frac{1}{R_{wb}} - \frac{1}{R_{wf}} \right) S_{wt}^{n-1} \right) \quad \text{(Active Dual-Water Model)}$$
$$\text{Clean-Sand Baseline (Archie Reference): } S_w = \left(\frac{a \cdot R_w}{\phi_t^m \cdot R_t}\right)^{1/n}$$
{% elif sw_params.model_key in ('simandoux', 'indonesian') %}
$$\frac{1}{R_t} = \frac{\phi_e^m \cdot S_w^n}{a \cdot R_w (1 - V_{sh})} + \frac{V_{sh} \cdot S_w}{R_{sh}} \quad \text{(Active Shaly-Sand Model)}$$
$$\text{Clean-Sand Baseline (Archie Reference): } S_w = \left(\frac{a \cdot R_w}{\phi_t^m \cdot R_t}\right)^{1/n}$$
{% else %}
$$S_w = \left(\frac{a \cdot R_w}{\phi_t^m \cdot R_t}\right)^{1/n} \quad \text{(Active Archie Equation)}$$
{% endif %}

